# Hirara, Fallen Scarlet

> Hirara is a jungle assassin who kills through lockdown, not raw burst. Her two skills drag together into an immobilizing engage or an untargetable escape, and a two-charge energy pool decides which one you can still afford. She is a terror when the fight is one isolated target, and a passenger the moment her charges are empty.

