- Core: Hunter Strike, Blade of Despair, Blade of the Heptaseas
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Seasoned Hunter, Killing Spree
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Ice Retribution
- Flex: Magic Boots over Tough Boots when Use when the enemy draft has low hard crowd control and Hirara can value cooldown tempo over resilience.; Rose Gold Meteor over Immortality when Use against magic burst that clips Hirara during entry before a revive would create a real trade.; Sea Halberd over Blade of the Heptaseas when Use when healing, shields, or high-extra-HP frontliners erase the first combo before the carry is reachable.; Endless Battle over Blade of the Heptaseas when Use when fights run long enough to land a basic after each skill: Divine Justice's true damage and move-speed proc out-value a single Ambush hit Hirara rarely sets up in extended skirmishes.
- Total cost: 11850 gold

Safe ranked jungle setup that follows the confirmed Hunter Strike and Blade of Despair core, then adds Ice Retribution and late revive value for controlled second entries.

### Snowball Execute (Jungle)

